 7. 🦋 Dolly gets her due 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Covers: Nicole Rifkin for The New Yorker, David Gahr/Getty Images "Pure Gold" — by illustrator Nicole Rifkin, who's also a musician — is the title of the Dolly Parton tribute cover for The New Yorker's new issue, out tomorrow.

 "I admire not only her and her music but also her generosity," Rifkin said. "She touched the lives of millions of kids with her Imagination Library ." TIME's Dolly tribute (above right) goes on sale Sept. 18.

